  "worked_solution": "Since we need to divide by $7$, we split the whole into $7$ equal parts horizontally.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129811/assets/bb8362ba449f1dc6dde21397007739a59cb9f99a240dce42970b6fd29d8d3b19.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{1}{35}$ of the whole.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{5}÷7=\\frac{1}{35}.\n$$",
